@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081

### Liste lesen (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies
X-Correlation-ID: manual-list

### Einzelnen Datensatz lesen (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/1

### Gültigen Datensatz anlegen (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: manual-create

{
  "movieCode": "F-999",
  "title": "Testfilm",
  "releaseYear": 2026,
  "durationMinutes": 90,
  "fskCode": "FSK_6",
  "minimumAge": 6
}

### Ungültigen Datensatz ablehnen (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: manual-validation

{}

### Vorhandenen fachlichen Schlüssel ablehnen (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: manual-conflict

{
  "movieCode": "F-101",
  "title": "Testfilm",
  "releaseYear": 2026,
  "durationMinutes": 90,
  "fskCode": "FSK_6",
  "minimumAge": 6
}

### Seed-Datensatz mit unverändertem Schlüssel ersetzen (200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieCode": "F-101",
  "title": "Testfilm aktualisiert",
  "releaseYear": 2026,
  "durationMinutes": 90,
  "fskCode": "FSK_6",
  "minimumAge": 6
}

### Unbekannten Datensatz idempotent löschen (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/999999
